<h1>About</h1>

<h2>University Cafeteria Supply Management System</h2>

<p>
    This application helps manage cafeteria supply requests
    by allowing users to add products, calculate costs,
    review requests, and confirm orders.
</p>

<h3>Main Features</h3>

<ul>
    <li>Add multiple products to a supply request.</li>
    <li>Calculate subtotal, preparation fees, and discounts.</li>
    <li>Save draft requests using Session.</li>
    <li>Save preferred priority using Cookies.</li>
    <li>Confirm and view previous requests.</li>
</ul>